{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>I have wrestled with my sister.</b> She said: at first Elohim judged me and joined me with my sister. Just as Betzalel, who comes from my sister, was chosen to make the work of the Tabernacle, so Oholiav, of the tribe of Dan, who comes from my family, will be chosen. <b>And I prevailed</b> — over her, that I defeated her: in the Eternal House there will be no builder from her seed, only from Naftali, who comes from my family, as it is written: ״וישלח ויקח את חירום ממטה נפתלי״ (and he sent and took Hiram from the tribe of Naftali)."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :register {:flags {0 ["the Eternal"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:42.447001698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}